                  <paragraph>ALSO CONTAINS: Gelatin, Glycerin, Soy Lecithin, Yellow Beeswax, Natural Creamy Orange Flavour, L-Lysine Acetate, Hesperidin Complex,  D&amp;C Blue # 1, Sodium Citrate, Titanium Dioxide, Ethyl Vanillin, L-Glutathione, FD&amp;C Yellow # 6.</paragraph>
